---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { getSeo } from '@lib/seo';
import { breadcrumb } from '@lib/schema';

// Dodie's wording, from docs/source/cancellation-policy-2026-11-05.pdf. Keep it exact. The $350 line is the one addition (Mark, 2026-11-05).
const seo = getSeo({
  path: '/cancellation-policy',
  title: 'Cancellation and Rescheduling Policy',
  description: 'The Dodie Kendall QHHT deposit, cancellation and rescheduling policy for sessions in Stuart, FL.',
});

const schemas = [breadcrumb([{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Cancellation Policy' }])];
const strong = 'font-medium text-ink';
const quickReference = [
  ["First cancellation, 7+ days' notice, rescheduled within 30 days (or next available)", 'Carries over to your new date'],
  ["Cancellation with less than 7 days' notice", 'Forfeited'],
  ['Not rescheduled within the 30-day window', 'Forfeited'],
  ['Second cancellation', 'Forfeited'],
  ['No-show', 'Forfeited'],
];
---
<Base seo={seo} schemas={schemas}>
  <section class="section-y bg-bg-base">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display">Cancellation and Rescheduling Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">Effective November 5, 2026</p>

      <div class="prose-content mt-10 space-y-8 text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
        <p>Thank you for choosing a QHHT session with me. Each session reserves a large block of my day just for you, so I ask every client to honor the policy below. It keeps scheduling fair for you and for others waiting for a session.</p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">Deposit</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">The fee is <strong class={strong}>$350 per session</strong>.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">A <strong class={strong}>$50.00 non-refundable deposit</strong> is required to reserve your session date.</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li>Your appointment is not confirmed until the deposit is received.</li>
            <li>The deposit is applied toward your session fee.</li>
            <li>The deposit is non-refundable under all circumstances. It can only be carried over to a rescheduled session as described below.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">Cancellation and Rescheduling</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">You may cancel <strong class={strong}>one time</strong> and keep your deposit, as long as you follow these steps:</p>
          <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li><strong class={strong}>Give at least 7 days' notice.</strong> Cancel at least one full week (7 days) before your scheduled appointment.</li>
            <li><strong class={strong}>Reschedule within 30 days.</strong> Your new session date must fall within 30 days of the date you cancel.</li>
            <li><strong class={strong}>If I am booked out.</strong> If no openings are available in that 30-day window, you will be scheduled for my next available date.</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="mt-3">When you reschedule this way, your $50.00 deposit carries over to your new appointment.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">When the Deposit Is Forfeited</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Your $50.00 deposit is forfeited, and a new deposit is required to book again, if any of the following happen:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
            <li>You cancel with <strong class={strong}>less than 7 days' notice</strong>.</li>
            <li>You <strong class={strong}>do not reschedule</strong> within 30 days of your cancellation date (or for my next available date, if I am booked out).</li>
            <li>You <strong class={strong}>cancel a second time</strong>, including cancelling a rescheduled appointment.</li>
            <li>You <strong class={strong}>do not show up</strong> for your appointment.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">Quick Reference</h2>
          <table class="mt-4 w-full border-collapse border border-border-subtle text-left text-sm md:text-base">
            <thead class="bg-bg-sunken text-ink">
              <tr>
                <th scope="col" class="border border-border-subtle p-3 font-medium">Situation</th>
                <th scope="col" class="border border-border-subtle p-3 font-medium">What happens to your $50 deposit</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {quickReference.map(([situation, outcome]) => (
                <tr>
                  <td class="border border-border-subtle p-3">{situation}</td>
                  <td class="border border-border-subtle p-3">{outcome}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">Client Acknowledgment</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">By paying the deposit, I confirm that I have read and agree to the Dodie Kendall QHHT Cancellation and Rescheduling Policy.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Questions? Contact Dodie Kendall at <a href="/" class="text-brand underline">dodiekendall.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
